w calls state.substrate_n_mg_n_per_m2() and state.substrate_p_mg_p_per_m2() instead of raw total_substrate_n/p(); lines 65-66 use plant_half_saturation_n_mg_n_per_m2 (converted via legacy_total_param_to_mg_per_m2) — dimensionally consistent","legacy_total_param_to_mg_per_m2() added in process.rs:14-20 using LEGACY_KINETIC_REFERENCE_FOOTPRINT_M2 = 0.1 m²","plant_substrate_limitation_drops_when_areal_store_is_depleted test (plant_algae_integration.rs:248-299) verifies substrate depletion actually reduces rooted-plant growth with nonzero substrate bias — addressing amendment fr-4-92b6a31f","save.rs:44-65 now parses JSON value first, checks has_serialized_stability_tracker(), and calls reseed_stability_tracker_if_missing() for both schema-3 and legacy schema-2 paths — addressing amendment fr-4-0a3f3f58","legacy_schema_v2_saves_without_tracker_reseed_stability_baselines test (save_load.rs:187-228) verifies that loading a v2 save without stability_tracker reseeds baselines from migrated water state","TankState::reseed_stability_tracker() helper (state.rs:203-207) extracts the seed_from_water pattern for reuse across new(), seeded_example(), and save loading","Only remaining geometry.water_volume_l() in src/ is save.rs:85 for the v2 migration gross-volume reference — correct and necessary","nitrogen_cycle.rs:78-79 uses state.water.doc_mg_c_per_l(volume_l) and do_mg_per_l(volume_l); algae_growth.rs:14-16 uses state.water.tan_mg_n_per_l, nitrate_mg_n_per_l, phosphate_mg_p_per_l — all concentration-based","Property test (proptest, 256 cases) covers all helpers plus substrate_volume_l, water_volume_l, substrate_n_mg_n_per_m2, substrate_p_mg_p_per_m2 for non-negativity across random geometry/chemistry inputs including substrate_depth > fill_height","ConcentrationView (water.rs:35-39) caches volume once; TankState::concentrations() produces it from single water_volume_l() call; plant_growth.rs:9-13 uses this pattern for the hot inner loop"],"findings_or_gaps":["Legacy process field names such as plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total still read as total-mass parameters even though runtime semantics now branch into concentration (mg/L) for water-column and areal density (mg/m²) for substrate — this naming inconsistency could confuse future contributors but is explicitly deferred to downstream normalization beads","TankState individual convenience methods (tan_mg_n_per_l, nitrite_mg_n_per_l, etc. at state.rs:213-271) each independently call self.concentrations() which re-invokes water_volume_l(); call sites using multiple individual methods in sequence still pay repeated volume recomputation. The hot paths (plant_growth, snapshot) correctly use ConcentrationView, so this is a minor efficiency concern for less-frequent convenience usage only","Schema-2 migration assumes legacy saves were authored with gross-volume-scaled dissolved totals; a hand-edited or previously pre-migrated schema-2 file would be rescaled again on load. This is acceptable given v2 saves are a transitional format"],"follow_up_or_amendments":["Legacy process field names (plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total, aob_k_tan_mg, etc.) should be renamed to reflect their now-concentration-based runtime semantics as part of the downstream normalization beads (tanksim-6e5.2.3, 6e5.2.4, 6e5.2.5)"],"outcome":"approved"},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6a967c3e-e13a-43de-b1b2-006fb8b3491c"}
